<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu Ltd seen issuing Y100 bln domestic bonds.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu Ltd seen issuing Y100 bln domestic bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd is expected to set terms on Tuesday on a planned issue of 100 billion yen of domestic bonds, underwriting sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The sources said the company was likely to issue both seven- and 10-year bonds.</p>
<p>A Fujitsu spokesman declined to comment.</p>
</text>
